Description: ISO builder and customizer for Edukasaun OS
 Eduka-Customizer builds Edukasaun OS live images from Debian stable,
 testing or sid. It extracts a Debian or Edukasaun OS live ISO (or
 bootstraps a new Debian base, or snapshots the running system), lets you
 install packages and Flatpak applications, choose the desktop
 (Eduka-Desktop, LXQt, Xfce, KDE Plasma, GNOME, window managers), change
 the Plymouth boot splash, login screen, wallpaper, APT sources and boot
 menu, edit the system live in a nested window, and builds a hybrid
 BIOS/UEFI ISO that can be tested in QEMU.
 .
 It also builds your own branding packages (replacing the identity of
 base-files, lsb-release, distro-info-data, desktop-base, the Debian logos,
 GRUB and the Calamares installer) and lets you edit any installed Debian
 package directly in the Package Workshop.
 .
 Eduka-Customizer runs on Debian, Edukasaun OS, Ubuntu and Ubuntu-based
 systems. The images it builds are always Debian stable, testing, sid or
 Edukasaun OS; Ubuntu-based images are not supported as a source.
